	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - Security - Events - Okta Attack Started",
	"Description": "Okta declared an attack in progress against the org, or ended one. Okta raises this when it sees a coordinated credential attack rather than isolated failures, so treat it as confirmation that the failure volume you are seeing is an attack and not noise.\n\nEvent types: security.attack.start, security.attack.end\n\nReference(s):\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/api/openapi/okta-management/management/tag/SystemLog/",
